[ MMMMMMSSMMMS MOOSSMSMMJMM MOOSSMMMSSSM MOOSSSSSCCSM MOOSSMSMSCSM MOOMMMSMSCSM MMMMSCSMCSSM SSSMSSCMSCSM SSSMSCSSCSSM SSSMSSMMSSSM SSSMMMMMMMMM ]
[ SSSSSSSMMMMMS SMMMMMMMSSSMM MMSMSJMMSCCSM MSSSSCSSSSSSM MSSCSSMMMSSSM MMMSMMMMMCMMM MSCSSMMMSOOMS MSCSCSCSOOOMS MSSSSMMMOOOMS MSCCSMSMOOOMS MSSMMMSMMMMMS MMMMSSSSSSSSS ]
[ SSMMMMSSSSSSSSSS SSMSSMMMMMMMMMMM SSMSSSSCSSSCSCSM SSMSCMSCSMSSCSSM SSMSSCSCSSMSSSSM MMMSCMSMSSMMMMSM MJMCSCSCSSMMSSSM MSSSSCSMCMSSSMSM MSSSCSSSSCSCSCSM MMMMMSSMMMMMMMMM SSMSSSSSSMSSSSSS SSMSSSSSSMSSSSSS SSMOOOOOOMSSSSSS SSMOOOOOOMSSSSSS SSMOOOOOOMSSSSSS SSMMMMMMMMSSSSSS ]
