[ SMMMSSMMMMMMMMMMMMM MMJMMMMSSSSSSSMSSSM MSCCSSSCCSSCSCSOOOM MSSCCCMSSSSCSSMOOOM MSCSSSMSCCSCCSMOOOM MMMSSSMSSCSSSSMOOOM MSSSSSMSCSCSCSMOOOM MSSSSMMMMMMSMMMOOOM MMSMSSMSSCSCSSMOOOM MSSMMSMSCCSCSCMMOOM MSOOMSMSSCSSSSSSMOM MSOOMSMSCCCSCCCSMOM MMMMMSMSSSSSSSMSMOM SSSSMSMMMMMMMMMSMOM SSSSMSSSSSSSSSSSMOM SSSSMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM ]
[ SSSSSSSSSSMMMMSSSSS SSSSSMMMMSMSSMSSSSS SSSMMMSJMMMCSMSSSSS SSMMSSSSSSCSSMSSSSS SMMSSCSCCMMSMMSSSSS SMSSMCMMSSSSSMSSSSS SMSMSCSCCSMSMMMSSSS SMSSSCSMSSMSCSMMMMM SMMMSSSSMSSCCSMSSSM MMMMSMMSCSSSSSSSSSM MOSSSSMMMSSMMMMMMMM MOOSOOMSMMMMSSSSSSS MOOOMOMSSSSSSSSSSSS MOOOOOMSSSSSSSSSSSS MMMMMMMSSSSSSSSSSSS ]
[ MMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMS MSSSSSSSSSSSSSSMS MSMSMMMMMMSSSSSMS MSMSSCSCSCSCMSSMS MSMSSSCJCSSSMMSMM MSMSMCSCSCMMMOOOM MSMSSSCSCSSMMOOOM MSMMMCCCSCSMMOOOM MSSSSSMSMMSMMOOOM MMMMMSSSMMSMMOOOM SSSSMMMMMSSSSSMMM SSSSSSSSMSSSSSMSS SSSSSSSSMMMMMMMSS ]
[ SSSMMMMMMMMMSSSSSSS SSMMSSSMMSSMMMMMMSS MMMSSSSSMSSMSSSSMMM MSSCSMCSMSSMSSOOOSM MSMSCMJCMMSMSMOMOSM MSSMSMCSSMSSSSOSOSM MSCSSSSCSMSMSMOMOSM MSSSMMSSMMCSCSOSOSM MSCSMSSSMSSMCMOMOSM MMSCSSCSSSCSSCOOOSM SMCSMMMMMMSSSSMMSSM SMSSMSSSSMMMMMMMMMM SMMMMSSSSSSSSSSSSSS ]
[ SSSSSSSMMMMMMMSSSS SMMMMMMMSSSSSMSSSS SMSSSSSMSCJCSMSSSS SMCCSMSSSMMMMMMMMM SMSMMMOOOOOOMMSSSM SMSSSCOOOOOOMMSMSM SMSMMMOOOOOOSSSSSM MMSSSMMMMSMMMSMCMM MSSMCSSSMSSCSSMSMS MSSCSCCCSSMSCMMSMS MSSSCSCSMMMCCSMSMS MMMMMSSSSSCSSSMSMS SSSSMMMSMMMSSSMSMS SSSSSSMSSSSSMSSSMS SSSSSSMMMMMMMMSSMS SSSSSSSSSSSSSMMMMS ]
[ SSSMMMMMMMMSSSSSS SSSMSSSMSSMSSSSSS SSSMSSCSSSMSSSSSS SMMMSMCSSSMMMMSSS SMSSCSSMMCSSSMSSS SMSSMSJSCSMSCMSSS SMSSMSSSSSSCSMMMM SMMSMMMMCMMSSSSSM SMSCMOOOOOMSMSSSM SMSSCOOKKOSCMSMMM MMSSMOOOOOMSSSMSS MSSSMMMSMMMMMMMSS MSCCSSMSSMSSSSSSS MSSMSSSSSMSSSSSSS MMMMMMSSSMSSSSSSS SSSSSMMMMMSSSSSSS ]
[ MMMMMSSSSSSSSS MSSSMMSSSSSSSS MSSSSMSSMMMMSS MSCSSMMMMSSMSS MSSCCSCSSSCMSS MMMJSMCSSSSMMS SMSSMMSSCSCSMM SMSCSSMMSMMSOM SMSSMCMMCSSMOM SMMMSSSCOOMMOM SSMSSSSMOKOOOM SSMSCCSMOOOOOM SSMSSMMMMMMMMM SSMSSMSSSSSSSS SSMMMMSSSSSSSS ]
[ SSSMMMMMMMMMMSSS SSSMOOSSMSSSMSSS SSSMOOSSSSSSMSSS SSSMOOSSMSSMMMMS SSMMMMMMMSSMSSMM SSMSSSSSSSSSSSSM SSMSSMSSMMSSMSSM MMMMSMMSSMMMMSMM MSSCSSMMMMMSMSSM MSMSCSSCSSMSCSSM MSJCSSCSSSMSSSMM MMMMSMMSMMMMMMMS SSSMSSSSMSSSSSSS SSSMMMMMMSSSSSSS ]
[ SSSSSMMMMMMMMMMMSSS SSSSSMSSOSSMSSSMSSS SSSSSMSMOSSSSJSMSSS SMMMMMSMMOOMSMMMMSS MMSSMSOOMMMSSSSSMMM MSCSMOOOSSSCSMSSCSM MSSSSOOSMMSSMMSMMSM MMMMCMMCMSCSMSSSMSM SSMMSMSSSSMCSCCSMSM SSMSSCSMSMSSMSCMMSM SSMSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSM SSMSSMMMMMMMMMMMSSM SSMMMMSSSSSSSSSMMMM ]
[ SSMMMMMMSSSSSSSSSSS SSMSSSJMMMMSSSSSSSS MMMMMSCSSSMSSSSSSSS MSSSMMSSSSMMMMSSSSS MSCSMSSMMSSSSMSSSSS MSCSMSSMMMMMSMSSSSS MMSCSSCSSSSMSMSSSSS SMSCSCSMMMSMSMSSSSS SMSMSSCSSMSMSMSSSSS SMSMSMCMSSSMSMSSSSS MMSMMMSSSMSMSMMMMMM MSSCSSMMMMSMSMOOOOM MSSSSCSSSSCSSSOOMOM MMMMCSSCMSCSSSOOOOM MSSSSSSSMSSMMSOOOOM MMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM ]
[ SSSSMMMMMMMMMMSSSSS MMMMMSSSSSSSSMMMMSS MSSSSSMSSSCSSMJSMSS MSMMMMMMMCMMMMSSMMM MSMSSSSMMSMSSMCSOOM MSMSCSSCSSMSSMSSMOM MSMSCSSMSSSSSMCSOOM MSMSSMMMSMMSSSSSMOM MSMMMSSMSSMSSMCSOOM MSMSSSSMSCMMMMSSMOM MSMCSSSCSSCSSMKSOOM MSSSSCSMSCSCSMSSMOM MMMMSCMMMSSSSMKSOOM SSSMSSSSCCSMMMOOOOM SSSMSSSSSSMMSMMMMMM SSSMMMMMMMMSSSSSSSS ]
]
DONNE "TOTAL COMPTE :NIVEAUX
DONNE "ABANDON FAUX
ECRANTITRE
DONNE "NIV 1
TANTQUE [ :NIV <= :TOTAL ] [
PREPARE ITEM :NIV :NIVEAUX
MANCHE
SI :ABANDON [ STOP ]
ECRANGAGNE
DONNE "NIV :NIV + 1
]
ECRANFINAL
FIN
